<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-SCHALKE SIGN GOOSSENS FROM GENOA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCHALKE SIGN GOOSSENS FROM GENOA.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>UEFA Cup holders Schalke said on Wednesday they had signed Belgian striker Michael Goossens from Italian second division side Genoa.</p>
<p>The German club's manager Rudi Assauer said Goossens had signed a four-year contract but did disclose how much they had paid for him.</p>
</text>
